			"Message": "chore(Rest): Bump Node engine requirement to v24\n\nUpdated the minimum Node.js version requirement from v18 to v24 in package.json. This aligns with the project's current development environment using Node v26.2.0 as the default version via NVM.\n\nThe change ensures that consumers of this package are aware of the minimum supported runtime version, which now targets Node v24+ (codename Krypton LTS).",
