			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize whitespace in Rust source and test files\n\nAdd blank lines between logical code blocks across OXC and SWC compilation modules, worker bootstrap injection templates, binary command parsing, and unit test fixtures. Standardize spacing around variable declarations, control flow boundaries, and multi-line string literals.\n\nThese are cosmetic-only changes with no functional impact. Improves code readability and follows Rust style conventions for vertical spacing.",
